10
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:26,350
It's so arrogant

11
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:27,350
teach her a lesson

12
00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:35,790
Long technical skills are dead

13
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:38,790
Even my defenses can't be broken when I see a genius.

14
00:00:38,790 --> 00:00:41,460
simply ridiculous

15
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:51,710
